                        "entry_id": "4bde3636-6c59-31f1-b969-d200066f4af3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To increase the power of (an internal combustion engine, either Otto or Diesel cycle) by compressing the inlet air with power extracted from the exhaust air (through using a turbocharger)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
